Description:It is your first main phase. You control Chainer's Torment with one lore counter (chapters I and II: it deals 2 damage to each opponent and you gain 2 life). You have Contentious Plan (proliferate, then draw a card) in hand with two blue mana floating. The opponent is at 2 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-saga-proliferate-chapter | A Saga's chapter ability triggers whenever a lore counter is put on it and the count reaches that chapter, by any means (CR 714.2b, 714.3b): proliferating the lore counter from 1 to 2 triggers chapter II now, 2 damage, instead of waiting for your next precombat main phase
